{"id":"812e9677da","t":"The World After the End","c":"cv","n":259,"l":259,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"the-world-after-the-end"},"u":1795103075299,"desc":"رجل لم يتراجع عندما عاد الآخرون إلى الماضي. تم استدعاء البشر فجأة ليصبحوا “مشاة”، وكانوا بحاجة إلى تنظيف البرج لإنقاذ العالم … الطابق 77: تم اكتشاف “حجر الانحدار”. يستطيع المشاة الآن “العودة” إلى الماضي. ببطء، غادر الجميع … تم تشكيل الأمل الأخير للإنسانية، كراب ديم “انتهز الفرصة”، المكون من أشخاص رفضوا التخلي عن العالم … وصل آخر ووكر إلى الطابق 100. لم يعد يعرف ما يجب تصديقه","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اثاره","اعادة احياء","اكشن","ايسكاى","بطل غير اعتيادى","بعد الكارثه","حربى","سحر"],"src":{"ml":"the-world-after-the-end"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-world-after-the-end|/manga/the-world-after-the-end/1/"},"2":{"ml":"the-world-after-the-end|/manga/the-world-after-the-end/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-world-after-the-end|/manga/the-world-after-the-end/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-world-after-the-end|/manga/the-world-after-the-end/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-world-after-the-end|/manga/the-world-after-the-end/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-world-after-the-end|/manga/the-world-after-the-end/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-world-after-the-end|/manga/the-world-after-the-end/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the-world-after-the-end|/manga/the-world-after-the-end/8/"},"9":{"ml":"the-world-after-the-end|/manga/the-world-after-the-end/9/"},"10":{"ml":"the-world-after-the-end|/manga/the-world-after-the-end/10/"},"11":{"ml":"the-world-after-the-end|/manga/the-world-after-the-end/11/"},"12":{"ml":"the-world-after-the-end|/manga/the-world-after-the-end/12/"},"13":{"ml":"the-world-after-the-end|/manga/the-world-after-the-end/13/"},"14":{"ml":"the-world-after-the-end|/manga/the-world-after-the-end/14/"},"15":{"ml":"the-world-after-the-end|/manga/the-world-after-the-end/15/"},"16":{"ml":"the-world-after-the-end|/manga/the-world-after-the-end/16/"},"17":{"ml":"the-world-after-the-end|/manga/the-world-after-the-end/17/"},"18":{"ml":"the-world-after-the-end|/manga/the-world-after-the-end/18/"},"19